# ── Code Owners ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Auto-requests review from the listed owner on any PR touching these paths, and
# documents where the blast radius is largest.
#
# Do NOT turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection on a
# solo repo. Nobody can approve their own PR, so that setting combined with
# enforce_admins makes every PR permanently unmergeable. The merge gate here is
# CI (required status checks).
#
# Paths are checked most-specific to least-specific; last matching rule wins.

# ── CI/CD & supply chain ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Any change to workflow files or Dependabot config is high-risk supply-chain.
/.github/ @pavlojs

# ── Who the bots answer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The handlers decide which rooms and senders get an answer and which
# invitations are accepted. A mistake here opens a bot to people it must ignore.
/shared/lib/ @pavlojs

# ── Sign-in and configuration ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Each bot's entry point signs in to the homeserver, and its config reads the
# allow list, the target room and the webhook address from the environment.
/dmbot/index.js    @pavlojs
/dmbot/config/     @pavlojs
/roombot/index.js  @pavlojs
/roombot/config/   @pavlojs

# ── Container & orchestration ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The images' user, base and install step, and the capabilities Compose drops.
/dmbot/Dockerfile   @pavlojs
/roombot/Dockerfile @pavlojs
/docker-compose.yml @pavlojs

# ── Security & legal docs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/SECURITY.md @pavlojs
/LICENSE @pavlojs
